# Local development media folder

Drop test images and videos here when running with `LOCAL_DEV=true`.

The backend exposes this folder as the `media` share (configurable via `DEV_SHARE_NAME`).

Supported formats:
- Images: jpg, png, gif, webp, heic, avif, etc.
- Videos: mp4, mkv, mov, webm, etc.

Requires ffmpeg installed for video thumbnails and transcoding.
